Package: sov
Title: Calculate `vs-SOVs` and `SOVs` for Assemblies with D-Dimensional Voting
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Keith", "Dougherty", email = "dougherk@uga.edu", role = c("aut")),
    person("Emma", "Bibina", email = "emma.bibina@uga.edu", role = "aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Calculates vote-specific and traditional Shapley-Owen power indices (vs-SOVs and SOVs) for spatial voting games in one to four dimensions. Evaluates voter influence through an a posteriori analysis of relative preferences.  Supports weighted voting and various voting thresholds. Compatible with ideal point estimates from NOMINATE, Optimal Classification, and MCMCpack.
